{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31068","headline":"将赴镇过太康县有题 · 薛能","name":"将赴镇过太康县有题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"才入东郊便太康，自听何暮岂龚黄。\n晴村透日桑榆影，晓露湿秋禾黍香。\n十万旌旗移巨镇，几多輗軏负孤庄。\n时人欲识征东将，看取欃枪落太荒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31068.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31068","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}